@startuml
actor "Account Holder" as User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API
User -> UI: Submit email and password
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /auth/sign-in (SignInDto)
activate API
API --> UI: 200 OK (SessionDto) or 400/401
deactivate API
UI --> User: Show result and store session on success
deactivate UI
@enduml
